    "lawCode": "Amd §911, Exec L",
    "lawSection": "Executive Law",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S4739\n\n\n\n PURPOSE :\n\nThis legislation designates Silver Lake as inland waterways.\n\n SUMMARY OF PROVISIONS :\n\nSection 1 amends Subdivision 4 of Section 911 of the Executive Law by\nadding Silver Lake to the list of water bodies defined as inland\nwaterways.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\n\nBy defining Silver Lake as an inland waterway, the municipalities and\norganizations along its banks will be eligible for Department of State\nand Environmental Protection Fund waterfront revitalization grants.\nThe opportunity to apply for and possibly receive grant monies is of\nconsiderable importance to the revitalization efforts of the Silver\nLake region.\n\n LEGISLATIVE HISTORY : New bill.\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS : None.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE : Immediately.\n",
